    "description": "Preserved binary ABI declarations and exact private compatibility adapters/tests. Video provider runtime supplies the existing IVideoSubSystem::Connect factory without exposing it through the typed catalog. The Linux VBSP host tool keeps its material and physics factories in its private legacy compile-tool adapters. Reviewed 2026-09-25 (R04-DRIFT, user decision): the imported matchmaking framework's IAppSystem::Connect, the Portal 2 GameUI's IGameUI::Initialize/Connect, the Box3D provider's IPhysics::QueryInterface and the VPhysics conformance test host, which loads each provider through its CreateInterface export.",
